msgid "Roles: {{roles}} · Authorities: {{authorities}} combined"
msgstr "Roles: {{roles}} · Authorities: {{authorities}} combined"

msgid "Cannot administer users"
msgstr "Cannot administer users"

msgid ""
"None of these roles grants an authority for administering users, so this "
"combination cannot manage any users regardless of its other authorities. "
"Add/Update User is the authority that grants it."
msgstr ""
"None of these roles grants an authority for administering users, so this "
"combination cannot manage any users regardless of its other authorities. "
"Add/Update User is the authority that grants it."

msgid "Can administer users, via {{authority}}"
msgstr "Can administer users, via {{authority}}"

msgid "Limited to managed user groups"
msgstr "Limited to managed user groups"

msgid ""
"This combination can only administer users in user groups it manages. "
"Whether a given user falls inside those groups depends on user-group "
"configuration, which this tool does not evaluate."
msgstr ""
"This combination can only administer users in user groups it manages. "
"Whether a given user falls inside those groups depends on user-group "
"configuration, which this tool does not evaluate."

