msgstr "An unknown error occurred"

msgid "Check what a role combination can manage"
msgstr "Check what a role combination can manage"

msgid ""
"Pick the roles a user holds. Their authorities are combined, because a user "
"administers other users with everything their roles grant together, not "
"with one role at a time."
msgstr ""
"Pick the roles a user holds. Their authorities are combined, because a user "
"administers other users with everything their roles grant together, not "
"with one role at a time."

msgid "User roles held"
msgstr "User roles held"

msgid "user admin"
msgstr "user admin"

msgid "Select one or more roles to see what they can manage."
msgstr "Select one or more roles to see what they can manage."

msgid "Look up a user"
msgstr "Look up a user"

msgid ""
"Search for a user to see which user roles they can manage, based on the "
"authorities of all their roles combined."
msgstr ""
"Search for a user to see which user roles they can manage, based on the "
"authorities of all their roles combined."

msgid "Search by name or username"
msgstr "Search by name or username"

msgid "At least {{n}} characters"
msgstr "At least {{n}} characters"

msgid "Search failed"
msgstr "Search failed"

msgid "No users match that search."
msgstr "No users match that search."

msgid "Role name is required"
msgstr "Role name is required"

msgid "Select at least one role to manage or one additional authority"
msgstr "Select at least one role to manage or one additional authority"

msgid "Admin role for managing users with roles: {{roles}}"
msgstr "Admin role for managing users with roles: {{roles}}"

msgid "Role name"
msgstr "Role name"

msgid "Enter new role name"
msgstr "Enter new role name"

msgid "User roles to manage"
msgstr "User roles to manage"

msgid "Additional authorities"
msgstr "Additional authorities"

msgid "Only authorities you hold yourself are listed."
msgstr "Only authorities you hold yourself are listed."

msgid "This role cannot administer users"
msgstr "This role cannot administer users"

msgid ""
"None of the selected roles or authorities grants Add/Update User, so "
"members of this role will not be able to manage other users."
msgstr ""
"None of the selected roles or authorities grants Add/Update User, so "
"members of this role will not be able to manage other users."

msgid "Create role"
msgstr "Create role"

msgid "Create new user admin role"
msgstr "Create new user admin role"

msgid ""
"Create a user role for user administrators: users who should manage other "
"users. Pick the roles the administrator should be able to manage, and the "
"new role will be given all authorities of those roles. This follows the "
"DHIS2 user management concept that requires a user to have the same or more "
"privileges than the users they manage."
msgstr ""
"Create a user role for user administrators: users who should manage other "
"users. Pick the roles the administrator should be able to manage, and the "
"new role will be given all authorities of those roles. This follows the "
"DHIS2 user management concept that requires a user to have the same or more "
"privileges than the users they manage."

msgid "Update existing user role"
msgstr "Update existing user role"

msgid ""
"Select an existing role and extend it with the authorities of additional "
"roles so its members can manage users with those roles as well. Use \"Check "
"what this role can manage\" to see which roles it can currently manage."
msgstr ""
"Select an existing role and extend it with the authorities of additional "
"roles so its members can manage users with those roles as well. Use \"Check "
"what this role can manage\" to see which roles it can currently manage."

msgid "Check what this role can manage"
msgstr "Check what this role can manage"

msgid "Existing role"
msgstr "Existing role"

msgid "No roles match the filter"
msgstr "No roles match the filter"

msgid "Add managed roles"
msgstr "Add managed roles"

msgid "The authorities of the selected roles will be added to {{role}}"
msgstr "The authorities of the selected roles will be added to {{role}}"

msgid "Only roles whose authorities you hold yourself are listed."
msgstr "Only roles whose authorities you hold yourself are listed."

msgid "Add authorities to role"
msgstr "Add authorities to role"

msgid ""
"There are no further roles you can add to this role. You can only add roles "
"whose authorities you hold yourself."
msgstr ""
"There are no further roles you can add to this role. You can only add roles "
"whose authorities you hold yourself."

msgid "This role already has the authorities of every other user role."
msgstr "This role already has the authorities of every other user role."

